### 4.4 Critical Constraints & Indexes

| Constraint | Table | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `uq_subject_selected` | `subject_selection` | **FCFS guarantee** — only one `SELECTED` per subject |
| `uq_staff_slot_per_window` | `subject_selection` | Unique slot per staff per window |
| `uq_one_open_window_per_batch_spec` | `selection_window` | Single OPEN window per batch/spec |
| `uq_faculty_preference_number` | `faculty_preference` | **PREF-03**: Each faculty uses each pref# once |
| `uq_subject_offering_preference` | `faculty_preference` | **PREF-02**: No two faculty same pref# for same offering |
| `uq_allocation_staff_offering` | [allocation](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/app/allocation/router.py#32-86) | Prevent duplicate staff-offering allocation |
| `trg_prevent_audit_log_update/delete` | `audit_log` | Immutable audit trail |
| `trg_prevent_window_time_update` | `selection_window` | Times immutable after SCHEDULED |

