| `LOG_FILE` | | [logs/app.log](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/logs/app.log) | Log file path |
| `EMAIL_BACKEND` | | [log](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/app/auth/router.py#99-104) | `smtp` or [log](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/app/auth/router.py#99-104) |
| `RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED` | | `true` | Rate limiting toggle |

### Production Validation (enforced at startup)
- `SECRET_KEY` ≥ 32 characters
- `DATABASE_URL` must start with `postgresql://`
- `SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE` must be `true`
- `SESSION_BACKEND` must be `redis`
- `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID/SECRET` must not be placeholders
- `DEV_AUTH_BYPASS` must be `false` (raises `RuntimeError` otherwise)

