## 12. Docker Infrastructure

### 12.1 docker-compose.yml (Development)

```yaml
services:
  db:     # PostgreSQL 15
    image: postgres:15
    volumes: pgdata
    healthcheck: pg_isready
    
  app:    # FastAPI backend
    build: .
    depends_on: db (healthy)
    ports: 8000:8000
    env_file: .env
    command: >
      sh -c "psql migrations → uvicorn --reload"
    volumes:
      - ./app:/app/app          # Hot-reload
      - ./migrations:/app/migrations
```

### 12.2 Dockerfile (Multi-stage)

- **Builder**: `python:3.12-slim` + gcc + libpq-dev → pip install
- **Runtime**: `python:3.12-slim` + libpq5 only
- **Healthcheck**: HTTP GET `http://localhost:8000/health` every 30s
- **CMD**: `uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000`

### 12.3 Migration Execution Order

Migrations run via [docker-compose.yml](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/docker-compose.yml) entrypoint command:

| Order | File | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | [schema.sql](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/migrations/schema.sql) | Base schema (staff, subject, selection_window, subject_selection, audit_log) |
| 2 | [002_window_lifecycle.sql](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/migrations/002_window_lifecycle.sql) | Window status lifecycle (DRAFT→SCHEDULED→OPEN→CLOSED→ARCHIVED) |
| 3 | [005_workload_schema.sql](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/migrations/005_workload_schema.sql) | Workload tables (program, semester, section, subject_offering, faculty_preference, allocation, workload_summary, faculty_role) |
| 4 | [006_academic_seed.sql](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/migrations/006_academic_seed.sql) | Seed 100+ subjects from MCA/BCA curriculum + offerings |
| 5 | [007_faculty_seed.sql](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/migrations/007_faculty_seed.sql) | Seed 27 faculty from FACULTY-LIST |
| 6 | [008_admin_override_schema.sql](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/migrations/008_admin_override_schema.sql) | allocation_locked flag + admin audit types |
| 7 | [009_window_audit_types.sql](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/migrations/009_window_audit_types.sql) | Expanded audit action types |
| 8 | [010_academic_cycle_support.sql](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/migrations/010_academic_cycle_support.sql) | `academic_cycle` table + FK linkage to all operational tables |
| 9 | [011_update_staff_emails.sql](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/migrations/011_update_staff_emails.sql) | Convert `@faculty.local` → `@hindustanuniv.ac.in` |

> **Note**: Migrations 003 and 004 are **UNKNOWN FROM REPOSITORY** (files not found).

