## 13. Demo Data Pipeline

### 13.1 Python Script ([scripts/demo_prep.py](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/scripts/demo_prep.py))

Automated 6-step pipeline:
1. Dev login → get JWT
2. Ensure active academic cycle
3. Open preference window (today)
4. Clear old allocations/preferences
5. Seed 5 shift-compatible random preferences per faculty via [psql](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/scripts/demo_prep.py#30-37)
6. Run allocation engine via API

### 13.2 SQL Script ([scripts/demo_seed.sql](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/scripts/demo_seed.sql))

Pure-SQL idempotent alternative:
- Same logic as Python script but runs entirely in PostgreSQL
- Requires manual `POST /api/allocation/run` after execution

