## 15. Known Limitations & Warnings

| Area | Issue | Severity |
|---|---|---|
| Session backend | [InMemorySessionBackend](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/app/auth/session_manager.py#107-159) loses sessions on restart (marked "DEVELOPMENT ONLY") | Medium |
| Audit constraint | Mismatch between migration 009 action types and code-emitted values | High |
| Report hardcoding | `ACADEMIC_YEAR = "2025-2026"` and `SEMESTER_TYPE = "EVEN"` hardcoded in [reports/service.py](file:///c:/Users/itsni/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/faculty_selection/app/reports/service.py) | Medium |
| No frontend auth guard | Routes are not protected by role-based guards in React — only backend enforces auth | Low |
| Missing migrations | Files `003_*.sql` and `004_*.sql` not found in repository | Info |
| TODO in main.py | `audit_router` inclusion is commented/TODO | Info |

